+ * Exports:
+ *   normalizeSector()        ΓÇö maps promptRouter SectorKeys ΓåÆ DC-KB-003 codes
+ *   getSectorCompatibility() ΓÇö returns compatibility level + reason for any pair
+ *   MATCH_ARCHETYPES         ΓÇö match type labels for match cards
+ *   detectFraudSignals()     ΓÇö HR-8 fraud signal detection
+ */
